2 CONT ===Correction 
2 CONT
2 CONT Formerly seen as Ariamiro II of Galicia, Rey Suevo de Galicia, which is an error.
2 CONT
2 CONT The last Suevic king of Galicia was Malaric (585); then the Visigoths took over the region. See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Galician_monarchs
