1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Rodrigo Martins De Nomães=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Also Known as, I Lord of Revinae, Silva-Secura or Señor de Reviñade y Silva-Escura and Rodrigo Martins De Nomamas.
2 CONT '''
2 CONT * Son of Rodrigo Romães Conde de Monterroso and Udraica Guterres 
2 CONT * D. Rodrigo Martins de Nomães ( 1215 -?) Was a nobleman and medieval knight of the Kingdom of Portugal , he was lord of Nomães, current Numão .
2 CONT * Born around 1180 in Portugal.
2 CONT * [https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p3357.htm#i100825 '''Our Royal Titled Noble Ancestors''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT *  Married: '''Dona Beatriz Annes Redondo,''' widow of Pedro Soares Coelho (son of Dom Soeiro Viegas Coelho and Dona Mayor Mendes de candarei), daughter of João Pires Redondo and his first wife, Govan Sen .
2 CONT
2 CONT =They had three daughters:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1.1. '''Dona Joanna Rodrigues de nomamas,''' married to Martim vasques da Cunha, the old, son of Vasco Lourenço da Cunha and Theresa Pires Portugal. Martim passed away in 1305, and Joanna passed away before 1308.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1.2. '''Dona Maria Rodrigues de Nomamas,''' Married To Martim Affonso de Resende.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1.3. '''Dona Urraca Rodrigues de Nomamas'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://pt.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rodrigo_Martins_de_Nom%C3%A3es Rodrigo Martins de Nomães, by Wikipedia]
2 CONT
2 CONT D. Rodrigo Martins de Nomães ( 1215 -?) Was a nobleman and medieval knight of the Kingdom of Portugal , he was lord of Nomães, current Numão .
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Family Relationships'''	
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Beatriz Anes Redondo, daughter of João Pires Redondo , governor of the localities of Neiva , Refojos and Riba de Ave and Gontinha Soares de Melo, of whom he had:
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Joana Rodrigues de Nomães''' ( 1240 -?) Married to Martim Vasques da Cunha , 4th lord of Morgado de Tábua .
2 CONT
