2 CONC He was married to Grevinne Terese Florentina SANCHOSDTR av Navarra. (9463) Han 1 g.m
1 NOTE Ramiro II became King of Leon & Asturias upon the abdication in 931 of Alfonso IV the Monk.  Ramiro II ruled until 951, and was succeeded by Ordono III known as El Bueno.
