2 CONT See: ''Francisco Antonio Doria, [http://groups.google.com/group/soc.genealogy.medieval/browse_thread/thread/a75c18ba4d2c05b0/393ab66b380d7104?hl=en&lnk=gst&q=baiao#393ab66b380d7104 soc.genealogy.medieval], Jul. 31, 1998.
