2 CONC s Gutierizi et Ermesinda iermana de domna Geluira regina que fuit mulier de Ordonius rex mater Ranemirus principe", names their children "filius…Suarius, Ermesinda et Adosinda et Froilo…cum infirmidate nata", records his foundatio
2 CONC n of churches "inter Durio et Uauga in villa Acibeto…in villa Sanganeto…", and that he committed "filia mea Froilo" to "domna Geluira abatisisa"[747].  A charter dated 2 Dec 1019 refers to the foundation of the monastery of Sever 
2 CONC by "Suario Gundesindiz et coniuge sua domna Goldrogodro" who bequeathed property to "Sandinu Suariz et suo iermano Gundesindo Suariz", confirmed in the charter by "Nunus Fredenandiz et Sandinus Fredenandiz…et de nostras iermanas"[
2 CONC 748].  
