2 CONT TRUNK BRANCH OF THE GUZMANES
2 CONT
2 CONT I Count Nuño Rodríguez lived in the days of Alfonso V until the reign of Fernando I, and married Doña Jimena Ordóñez. He followed  II Rodrigo Núñez, who married Doña Urraca and died in 1,086, leaving the kingdom to his son  III Nu
2 CONC ño Ruiz, who died in 1130 and was married to Doña Elvira de Manzaneda and had  IV Ruiz Núñez, who married Godo Guzmán and They had  V Alvar Ruiz de Guzmán, who married Doña Urraca de Castro
2 CONT
