2 CONT * Buried	Mosteiro de Vila Boa do Bispo, Vila Boa do Bispo, Marco de Canaveses, Porto, Portugal
2 CONT * Noble family	House of Ribadouro
2 CONT * Spouse '''The name of his wife is unknown - not Velida Trutesendes'''
2 CONT * Issue	
