1 NOTE First name originally was Munio.
2 CONT I have decided to change the surname Munio to the present day spelling of Muniz so that future researchers who are investigating the Muniz's ancient heritage will recognize that name.
2 CONT Many of you who are into traditional genealogy may not be in total agreement with the liberty I have taken in changing the traditional name to the more modern one. But since this Site reflects my study and research I feel I should
2 CONC  have the freedom to add some form of clarity to this family tree.
2 CONT I have also changed the spelling of Mendes to Menendez while I was at it. A lot of study of the history of names went into this project. Be aware that in my Casa conventional rules have been made to be changed.
