2 CONC Henri's 20-Great Grandfather.  "There is no king who has not had a slave among his ancestors, and no slave who has not had a king among his."   
2 CONT >> Good quote from Helen Keller - Garcia Ordonez Lord of VILLAMAYOR is my 21st great grandfather, King Richard the Lionhearted, my 27th great grandfather, and so on....(once you're in the family .. well, they all intermarried!)  -
2 CONC cggpd <<<<
