2 CONT Aznar Galíndez I
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Eneca Garcés, probably a Basque, and they had four children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Matrona, who married García Galíndez
2 CONT
2 CONT Eilo
2 CONT
2 CONT Centulf
2 CONT
2 CONT Galindo Aznárez I, later Count of Aragon
2 CONT --------------------
