2 CONT * http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CASTILE.htm#AlfonsoVIdied1109B
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alfonso_VI_de_Le%C3%B3n
