2 CONT i)      '''    FRONILDE Fernández ''' (-after 10 Feb 1187).  Barton names Fronilde Fernández as daughter of Fernando Núñez and Mayor Rodríguez, and niece of Conde Gómez Núñez[3041].  "Comitissa Fronilla Ferdinandi" donated propert
2 CONC y to the monastery of Ferreira by charter dated 17 Dec 1175, subscribed by "comes Gometius, comes Urgellensis"[3042].  She made a grant to Ferreira de Pallares 10 Feb 1187[3043].  
