2 CONT b)     '''    GUIOMAR Rodríguez''' .  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "Conde D. Gomes Fernandez, D. Guiomar Fernandez, D. Teresa Fernandez, D. Maria Fernandez, La Condesa D. Milagre" as the children of "El Conde D.
2 CONC  Fernan Perez de Trava Conde de Trastamar", adding in a later passage that "D. Dia Ximenez Señor de los Cameros" married "D. Guiomar Fernandez"[2787].  Alfonso VIII King of Castille granted the town of Herce, Rioja to "Didaco Seme
2 CONC nez et uxori vestre domna Giomar et filiis et filiabus vestris" by charter dated 9 Apr 1173[2788].  “Didacus Ximenez cum uxore mea Guiomar et sororibus meis domna Urraca et domna Teressa, domna quoque Sanctia et domina Maria et cu
2 CONC m omnibus filiis et filiabus nostris...” donated property to the monastery of San Prudencio, for the souls of “...patris nostri Dni Semenez et Dnæ Mariæ uxoris eius”, by charter dated 29 Aug 1181[2789].  "Domina Guiomar eius filia
2 CONC …cum filio meo Roderico Didaci" implemented the testament of "mater mea comitissa domina Fronila" in favour of Meira by charter dated 1199[2790]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly as his first wife, FERNANDO Ponce, son of conde PONCE [II] Giraldo de Cabrera, Señor de Cabrera, Vizconde de Gerona y Ager & his second wife María Fernández de Traba (-1200, bur Moreruela).  Conde 1178.  Mayordomo 
2 CONC mayor of Alfonso IX King of Leon 6 Mar 1189 to 30 Aug 1189.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly DIEGO Jiménez de los Cameros, son of JIMENO Iñíguez & his second wife Endulcia --- (-after 20 Aug 1181). 
2 CONT
