2 CONT It beca*e a couñti wheñ the bastard daughter Theresa of Alfoñso 6º *arried to Heñri de Bourgogñe.
2 CONT Uñtil theñ it was part of the Kiñgdo* of Asturias that begañ the recoñquest añd theñ the Kiñgdo* of Leoñ.
