2 CONC  y Rojas Manrique her mother → Juana de Rojas Manrique de Mendoza her mother → Constanza de Mendoza Mate de Luna her mother → Mayor de Mendoza Manzanedo her mother → Juan Fernández De Mendoza Y Manuel her father → Fernando Díaz de
2 CONC  Mendoza his father → Teresa Jofre Tenorio his mother → Elvira Sánchez de Velasco, Señora de Albendín y la Bobadilla her mother → Sancha Carrillo y Osorio her mother → García Gómez Carrillo de Molina, Señor de Ormaza y Mazuelo her
