2 CONT 1. Abd Al Rahman I of Córdoba . Born in 731. 1st independent emir from 755 . Marry Zaibra. He dies on November 25, 788. They are parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Sulayman. W Ali of Toledo . He passes away in 801.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Abd Allah.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Hisham I "the Appreciated" of Cordoba . Born on April 26, 757. Emir from 788. He died on June 12, 796. He is the father of:  
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Al Hakham I of Córdoba . Born in 770. Emir since 796. He married Adjab . He dies on July 16, 822. They are parents of:  
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Abd Al Rhaman II of Córdoba . Born in 792. Emir since 822. He married Al Shifa . He dies on November 17, 852. They are parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Mohammed I of Córdoba . Born in August 823. Emir from 852. He married Ushar . He died on September 29, 886. They are parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.   On the World. Born in 843. Emir from 886. He dies on June 24, 888.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Abd Allah I of Cordoba . Born on March 7, 844. Emir from 888. He married Íñiga Onneca Fortúnez de Pamplona , daughter of Fortún Garcés "el Monje" and Auria Ibn Muza. He dies on December 25, 912. They are parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.   Mohamed. Marry Muzna. They are parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.   Abd Al Rhaman III of Córdoba. Born on January 7, 891. Emir de912 a929. 1st Caliph of Cordoba from 929 . He dies on October 15, 961.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Zahabon Ibn Zayd from Córdoba . Born around the year 890. He is the father of:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Zara Bint de Córdoba . Been born towards 915. It contracts marriage with Lovesendo Ramírez de Amaya . They are parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Abdou Nazar de Amaya . Born around 940. He married Unisco Godínez . They are parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Trastamiro Abdu Nazar de Amaya . Born around 965. He married Dordia . They are parents of:
