2 CONC dara married "D. Gomes Gonçalues Giron"[174].  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Estevan Annez sin hijos, D. Aldara Annez, D. Elvira Annez, D. Sancha Annez no casó ni tuvo hijos" as the children of "D. Juan Garci
2 CONC a de Sousa el Pinto" and his wife "D. Urraca Fernandez", recording in a later passage that "D. Gomes Gonçalez Giron" married "Doña Aldara Anez"[175].  
