2 CONT
2 CONT Mendo Fernandes de Bragança is your brother's ex-wife's 21st great grandfather. You
2 CONT   → Carlos Héctor Angenscheidt Baridon, I your brother → Ana María Lorente Mourelle his ex-wife → María Cristina Mourelle Ruano her mother → Cristina Ruano Fournier her mother → Federico Agustín Ruano de Arteaga her father → Rafae
2 CONC l Juan Nepomuceno Ruano Reissig his father → Agustín Ruano Gallén his father → Juana Agustina Gallén Fernández his mother → Lucía Fernández de Agüero her mother → Petrona Cabral de Melo her mother → Juan Cabral de Ayala her father
2 CONC  → Juan Cabral de Melo Alpoin his father → Margarida Cabral de Melo his mother → Matias Nunes Cabral her father → Nuno Lourenço Cabral de Melo his father → Grimaneza Afonso Cabral de Melo his mother → Nuno Velho Cabral her father 
2 CONC → Violante Velho Cabral his mother → Fernão Velho Anes, senhor de Veleda her father → Margarida Anes Duro his mother → João Aires Duro her father → Aires Rodrigues de Urrô his father → Rui Dias de Urrô his father → Urraca Méndez d
2 CONC e Bragança his mother → Mendo Fernandes de Bragança
