1 NOTE Facts: Mayordomo of Alfonso VII. Paternal Ancestry, Osorio family of Castile. His maternal ancestry is from Cabrera and Trava of Leon and Galicia and Dukes of Urgell and Catalunia related to Nunez de Guzman the house of Toral.
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT Nobilario das Familias de Portugal, Felgueiras Gayo Carvalhos de Basto 2a Edizao Braga 1989
2 CONT Vol III pg 584 Ponces.
2 CONT Source II, Charles Arade his book, Tequesta.
2 CONT Digital collections at:
2 CONT http://digitalcollections.fiu.edu/tequestafiles/1967/67_1_04.pdf pp1-28
2 CONT Murga Sanz, Vicente, Juan Ponce de Leon, 1959 pp 385
2 CONT Tio Aurelio, Fundacion de San German, San Juan (1956- 274 pp)
2 CONT Tio Aurelio, Fuentes Para la Historia de Puerto Rico, San German, PR. 1961, pp 653
2 CONT Note: A lot of work that Murga Sanz did wasn't acknowledged by Tio.
2 CONT In the same light, a lot of work that Tio did wasn't acknowledged by Murga.
2 CONT They do agree on some points without agreeing or referencing one another.
2 CONT Each had documents that were important. Unfortunately, one important document wasn't included in the book by Tio. I have used these sources to work on the family tree's of Juan Ponce de Leon born 1400, Died: 1469 downward from him
2 CONC .
2 CONT Families that preceded him are from my own research within the book by Felgueiras Gayo listed above to fill in missing birth datesand persons throughout the tree.
2 CONT Source: PARES Ministerio de Cultura Spain for all Ponce de Leon
