2 CONT
2 CONT      Fáfila, duque de Cantabria was "hijo de Chindasvinto."2 He was born circa 660. He was the son of Chindaswinth, King of the Visigoths and Rekiberga (?).1
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
