2 CONC lear="all"></br><center>Abbaye-aux-Dames<br><i>founded by William the Conquerer and Matilda, in Cane France.</i></br><!-- 2871 --></td></tr></table></td>
2 CONT <td valign=top><table border="1" align="center" width="220"><tr><td bgcolor=ffffff><img src="http://www.renderplus.com/hartgen/images/churches/hommesfrontcr.jpg"alt="Image of Abbaye-aux-Hommes" width="200" align="center"></img><br
2 CONC  clear="all"></br><center>Abbaye-aux-Hommes<br><i>founded by William the Conquerer and Matilda, in Cane France.</i></br><!-- 2871 --></td></tr></table></td>
