1 NOTE
2 CONT 1.  Robert was married on his way to Palestine.  He was titled 'Duke Normandy'.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Robert pawned Normandy to William when he joined the crusades of Pope Urban, II.  He was defeated at the battle of Tinchobrai.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  He was captured by his younger brother Henry in 1106 and held until he died. Unknown GEDCOM info: MH:N87 Unknown GEDCOM info: CB0B33AE-C238-413A-AD00-402BA9B20E2D
