2 CONT
2 CONT     * Kimberly LoPrete, "Adela of Blois and Ivo of Chartres: Piety, Politics, and the Peace in the Diocese of Chartres", Anglo-Norman Studies 19
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Parsons, John Carmi. Medieval Mothering (New Middle Ages), 1996
