2 CONT     1. Scottish Kings, Scot. 28, p. 1-50
2 CONT     2. Scots Peerage, Scot 2b, v. 1, p. 2
2 CONT     3. Burke's Peerage, Eng. P, 1949, pref. p. 252, 286
2 CONT     4. The Royal Lines of Succession, A16A225, p. 8
2 CONT     5. The Kings of England, Eng. 176, p. 24-33
2 CONT     6. The Royal Daughters of England, Eng. 120, v. 1, p. 39
2 CONT     7. Royal Fam. of Eng., Scot., and Wales, Eng. 260, v. 1, p. 33-46, gen. p. 9-15
2 CONT     8. Plantagenet Ancestry, Eng. 116, p. 6
2 CONT     9. Espolin (GS #12462, pt 1, p. 98)
