2 CONT Robert de Bourgogne (1040-1113) Edit with form  Edit History 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Capet de Bourgogne was born circa 1044 to Robert I de Bourgogne (1011-1076) and Hélie de Semur (1016-aft1055) and died 1086 of unspecified causes. He married Sibylle of Sicily circa 1101 .  France,GermanyGermany,France Ance
2 CONC stors are from France, Germany. Little is known about Robert. There are no signs of any children. 
2 CONT
