1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''GUILLAUME IX Duke of Aquitaine(22 Oct 1071-10 Feb 1126)'''
2 CONT s/o son of GUILLAUME VIII Duke of Aquitaine & Hildegarde de Bourgogne [Capet] 
2 CONT x (1089, divorced 1090) ERMENGARDE d'Anjou
2 CONT xx (1094, divorced 1115) PHILIPPA [Mathilde] de Toulouse
2 CONT *GUILLAUME d'Aquitaine (1099-Santiago de Compostela 9 Apr 1137, bur Santiago de Compostela)
2 CONT *AGNES [Mathilde] ([late 1103][618]-8 Mar [1160 or <])
2 CONT * four daughters
