2 CONC ke William IX of Aquitaine (Journal of Medieval History), 1993 Meade, Marion. Eleanor of Aquitaine, 1991 Merwin, W.S. Sir Gawain and the Green Knight, 2002. pp xv-xvi. New York: Alfred A. Knopf. ISBN 0-375-41476-2. Owen, D.D.R. El
2 CONC eanor of Aquitaine: Queen and Legend Parsons, John Carmi. Eleanor of Aquitaine: Lord and Lady, 2002 Pasero, Nicolò, ed.: Guglielmo IX d'Aquitania, Poesie. 1973 Verdon, J. La chronique de Saint Maixent, 1979. Waddell, Helen. The Wa
2 CONC ndering Scholars: the Life and Art of the Lyric Poets of the Latin Middle Ages, 1955 [edit] External linksComplete works (external link) Works, translated by James H. Donalson (external link) Smythe, Barbara. Trobador Poets: Selec
