2 CONC  record" of his daughter Urraca Alfonso[1124].  Salazar y Castro states that Urraca Alfonso married "Álvaro Pérez de Guzmán"[1125], although in another section of his work he names the wife of Álvaro Pérez de Guzmán as "doña María
2 CONC  de la Cerda Señora de Gibraleón"[1126].  It is possible that Europäische Stammtafeln has confused this Urraca with Urraca, daughter of Alfonso IX King of León, who married Pedro Núñez de Guzman.  The contradictory evidence provid
2 CONC ed by Salazar y Castro has not yet been explained.  
