0 @N6000000000945071501@ NOTE Grevinne av Castilla. 
1 CONT Hennes far hadde gjort opprør med Ordoños far, Ramiro II. Han ble tatt til fange og
1 CONT måtte gi sin datter Urraca som garanti for fred. Hun ble forskutt, men senere gjeninnsatt.
1 CONT Urraca døde i 965 i klosteret Santos Cosme y Damian i Covarrubias som hun hadde
1 CONT stiftet.
0 @N6000000000945071690@ NOTE Urraca var arvegrevinne til grevskapet Aragon. 
1 CONT Hun var mor til Garcia III av Navarra, Ramiro som døde i 992 og Gonzalo, som arvet
1 CONT Aragon med titel av konge under sin brors overhøyhet.
0 @N6000000002187750513@ NOTE Urraca Fernández
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Urraca Fernández (died 1007), infanta of Fernán González of Castile, was the queen consort of two Kings of León and one King of Navarre between 951 and 994.
1 CONT
1 CONT She was first married by her father to Ordoño III of León in 951. Fernán's support of Sancho the Fat cost her her husband's affection and she was repudiated in 956. By him she had two, and possibly three children:
1 CONT
1 CONT Ordoño, who died young 
1 CONT Theresa, who became a nun 
1 CONT (perhaps) Bermudo II of León, whose maternity is subject to scholarly debate 
1 CONT In 958, after Ordoño's death, she was remarried to Ordoño IV. He died in 960.
1 CONT
1 CONT Her third and most important marriage was contracted in 970 to Sancho II of Pamplona. Both Sancho and Urraca were grandchildren of Sancho I of Pamplona, because Urraca's mother was Sancho I's daughter Sancha. With Sancho, she had 
1 CONC several children:
1 CONT
1 CONT García IV of Pamplona 
1 CONT Ramiro (died 992) 
1 CONT Gonzalo, who ruled the County of Aragon with Urraca as regent 
1 CONT Abda (Urraca) the Basque, given to Almanzor before entering a convent 
0 @N6000000000945071458@ NOTE Bermudo ?den Verkbrudne? var konge av Leon 982 -   999. 
1 CONT Han kjempet mot sin fetter, Ramiro III og forenet Leon med Galicien og Castilla.
1 CONT I 992 ble han overvunnet av maurerne som hadde oversvømmet hans rike etter ordre
1 CONT av Almanzor. Han tilbrakte de siste år av sin regjeringstid med å reparere ruinene etter denne
1 CONT invasjon.
1 CONT Han var gift
1 CONT 1. gang i 983 med Velasquita av Castilla,
1 CONT 2. gang ca. 992 med hennes søster, Elvira.
0 @N6000000002176683356@ NOTE Nephew of Alfonso I, he abdicated in favor of Alfonso II following defeat by
1 CONT the Moors.
