0 @N6000000000945071678@ NOTE Andregoto var arvegrevinne av Aragon. 
1 CONT Galindo Aznaréz var den annen greve av Aragon. Han ga mellom 795 og 815 Jaca
1 CONT den første grunnlov. Det synes å være sikkert at far til Andregoto også het Galindo Aznaréz,
1 CONT den her omtalte Galindo var muligens hennes fars farfar.
0 @N6000000003051221404@ NOTE [Wikipedia, "Andregota Galíndez", retrieved 5 Oct 07]
1 CONT Andregota Galíndez was Countess of Aragón from 922 to 925, being daughter of Count Galindo II Aznárez by his second wife, Sancha Garcés of Pamplona. She married García III, king of Pamplona. After 925, Aragón was added to the king
1 CONC dom of Pamplona, until the later split that created the Kingdom of Aragón and the kingdom of Navarre. García, who was her first cousin, divorced Andregota due to consanguinity, and remarried. Andregota apparently remarried and had
1 CONC  further children, although the details have not been discovered. Endregota, wife of 11th century count Sancho Maceratiz, was a descendant of this later marriage.
