0 @N6000000003949741581@ NOTE Sancho I Garcés (d. 925), king of Pamplona (Navarre) from 905. He expanded his kingdom south of the Ebro River and maintained its independence in spite of the sack of his capital in 924 by the Umayyad caliph 'Abd ar-Rahman III of 
