1 CONT ==========
1 CONT
1 CONT William I of England
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT William I
1 CONT King of the English (more...)
1 CONT
1 CONT Reign 25 December 1066 – 9 September 1087
1 CONT Coronation 25 December 1066
1 CONT Predecessor England: Edgar Ætheling (uncrowned), Harold II
1 CONT Normandy: Robert I the Magnificent
1 CONT Successor England: William II Rufus
1 CONT Normandy: Robert II Curthose, Duke of Normandy
